WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.994 --> 00:00:15.297
A new day!

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:17.616
Good morning, Snezhnograd!

00:00:21.536 --> 00:00:23.255
...This is all the way from Natlan!

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:23.427
Ohh!

00:00:23.427 --> 00:00:24.860
We gotta get our hands on those gems...

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:25.452
...Mm-hmm!

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:48.821
*hum*...

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.265
Natlanese gems...

00:00:58.732 --> 00:00:59.565
The ball

00:00:59.565 --> 00:01:00.697
The gangs...

00:01:00.697 --> 00:01:01.651
These are troubled times...

00:01:01.651 --> 00:01:03.456
Here, keep the change

00:01:03.456 --> 00:01:04.268
Huh?

00:01:07.758 --> 00:01:08.529
Ah...

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:24.953
Lady Vesna!

00:01:30.816 --> 00:01:32.390
Vesna...? Ugh!

00:01:34.182 --> 00:01:35.180
...Huh?

00:01:37.247 --> 00:01:38.854
Such a lively ball...

00:01:38.854 --> 00:01:40.499
How could I miss it?

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.398
I hear you're after the gems?

00:01:43.417 --> 00:01:44.697
Well, I'm sorry...

00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:47.379
But so am I

00:01:47.379 --> 00:01:48.403
Ugh!

00:02:02.496 --> 00:02:04.325
For the Tsaritsa!

00:02:04.325 --> 00:02:04.914
Attack!

00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:15.696
Finish the job! We'll be rich! Charge...!

00:02:15.696 --> 00:02:17.769
In your dreams, you're going to jail!

00:02:17.961 --> 00:02:19.197
Surround them!

00:02:40.818 --> 00:02:42.848
Thank you so much

00:02:42.864 --> 00:02:44.241
I can't believe those brutes

00:02:44.241 --> 00:02:46.073
Warranted the Druzhna...

00:02:46.215 --> 00:02:47.284
Them?

00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:48.915
Oh, they didn't

00:02:48.918 --> 00:02:49.286
...What?

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.989
...Fabricating import logs is a crime

00:02:52.008 --> 00:02:55.696
And using forbidden alchemy to forge gemstones?

00:02:55.696 --> 00:02:56.893
An aggravating factor

00:02:57.894 --> 00:02:59.386
So, I hope you had a good night...

00:02:59.764 --> 00:03:01.608
But the afterparty's gonna be in prison

